/**
 * `RestaurantArenaLayout.scale` from the last paint. Every size in this
 * file — font sizes through `fs`, the padding and row pitch around them
 * through `u` — is authored against the 520×740 baseline canvas and
 * multiplied by this, so a 1440×900 window gets bigger type in a bigger
 * room rather than baseline type marooned in one. A compact canvas pins
 * this at 1: there is no room there to spend on growing anything.
